  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br />Number of solutions is equal to the coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math> in the expansion of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />or the coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math> in the expansion of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow>